   ["and some toothpaste.","আর কিছু টুথপেস্টও দরকার।","aee53ccf-1f3f-49d4-989c-96606684c866","2c419c28-fca8-449b-aba9-fb70559e1c5d"]
  ],
  "eng_for_ben:pod-1:SC10-S06": [
   ["Sunscreen is down there on your right,","সানস্ক্রিন ওইখানে আপনার ডানদিকে,","f3d54e12-858b-4a6a-86ea-2911127e1cb1","f7948dcc-e8e4-482c-b20b-f84b6d91f320"],
   ["and you'll find toothpaste just round the corner.","আর টুথপেস্ট আপনি ঠিক কোণা ঘুরলেই পেয়ে যাবেন।","e6b8c96d-d7c9-48e1-8e08-d816b98d60e2","9777a465-9f68-4cae-886d-a70f53d06abd"]
  ],
  "eng_for_ben:pod-1:SC10-S07": [
